{'symbol': 'FE', 'date': '2023-06-02 09:34:00', 'title': 'FIRSTENERGY COMPLETES NINE-MILE TRANSMISSION LINE UPGRADE IN EASTERN OHIO', 'text': 'PROJECT IS PART OF LARGER 64-MILE LINE REBUILD TO ENHANCE RELIABILITY AKRON, OHIO , JUNE 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- AMERICAN TRANSMISSION SYSTEMS, INC. (ATSI), A SUBSIDIARY OF FIRSTENERGY CORP. (NYSE: FE), HAS UPGRADED NINE MILES OF A HIGH-VOLTAGE POWER LINE IN CARROLL AND HARRISON COUNTIES IN OHIO TO STRENGTHEN THE REGIONAL TRANSMISSION SYSTEM. THE SECOND PHASE OF A LARGER 64-MILE TRANSMISSION LINE PROJECT, THE REBUILT SEGMENT WILL ENHANCE SERVICE RELIABILITY FOR OHIO EDISON CUSTOMERS, IMPROVE SYSTEM RESILIENCY AND ACCOMMODATE INCREASING CUSTOMER DEMAND FOR ELECTRICITY IN THE FUTURE.'}